	quest.7D9BF3D6443C241C.quest_desc: [
		"Normally it is recommended to learn this mod in creative and if you want you can open a singleplayer world and do that."
		""
		"But some important details to think about when building in survival is:"
		"- Slowly increase forces, don't build a massive balloon for a small carriage."
		"- Stand or sit on your creation, the best way to prevent it from flying away is to be on it."
		"- Once you get high enough the hot air density, atmosphere air density, and weight will balance out and you will stop going up."
	]
